Water Octoroks behave very similarly as they did in {{BotW}}. The Rocks that they spit out can now be sent back to them with [[Recall]]. Water Octoroks are the only Octoroks that appear in the [[Depths]].

==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Water Octoroks are [[Octorok]] [[Enemy|Enemies]] that often drop [[Octo Balloon]]s, [[Octorok Eyeball]]s, or [[Octorok Tentacle]]s upon defeat. Killing one also rewards the [[Warrior]]s with an [[Octorok Trophy]] at the end of a [[Challenge]] or [[Scenario]].

Water Octoroks can be found as some of the main [[Enemy|Enemies]] in Challenges such "[[Sidon vs. the Octoroks]]", and are always found in small bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] such as ponds or puddles.
{{Noncanon|End}}

